      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont want a hobby or a group. i dont want to \"express myself\" through art. it's not that i'm stuck, it's that there's nothing left to unearth. it's just blank. i'm tired of fighting to feel something that isn't there. wouldn't it be easier if the noise just stopped? if i could just finally get some actual peace and not have to pretend anymore?",
